{"about":["This is an emulation of the classic PS1 action-adventure title, Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain, playable on PS4 and PS5 for the first time.","A dark, gothic fantasy, Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain takes gamers on an epic quest through a Vampire kingdom fraught with murder, magic and vengeance.","Accentuated with cinema-quality voice-overs, dynamic lighting effects and more than 25 minutes of revolutionary full-motion-video footage, Legacy of Kain features an engrossing storyline that invites gamers to embark on a journey through an expansive world containing more than 100 hours of intense, blood-sucking, spell-casting gameplay."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/028d03a3d9c25d494dce1a9d7db0cc77d685eefe10517132.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/028d03a3d9c25d494dce1a9d7db0cc77d685eefe10517132.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/8567be2a8af2f4ef0603ce0dcca62e8f88881a60ca25b79e.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/8567be2a8af2f4ef0603ce0dcca62e8f88881a60ca25b79e.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/1f6ede9faf2ce40db3c072bb1b7658ba5bbf5eb23465b02d.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/1f6ede9faf2ce40db3c072bb1b7658ba5bbf5eb23465b02d.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/9008f7021b848b1e1339f9764d11498013506a619e91be6a.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/9008f7021b848b1e1339f9764d11498013506a619e91be6a.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/13e7ad3347d4638bd8b51b9b49a648b0872b3557916e06ff.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/0917/13e7ad33